{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Writes a control's `scene` facet whole: read-modify-write of the ONE record key (every other key — the legacy `three` facet included — passes through verbatim). Creates the facet when absent (created:true). Journals old/new on the control's _patches record with facet 'scene' (revert = write_control_scene of the entry's old). Returns the new content hash.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\n","params":[{"desc":"Library name.","name":"lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"Control name within the library.","name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"desc":"The whole scene facet as a JSON object (nodes/mounts/state/bindings/wires/env — docs/scene-facet-design.md). Whole-object by design: the store re-serializes JSON canonically, so text snippets cannot be byte-stable.","name":"scene","type":"JSONObject"},{"desc":"Optional concurrency token: the hash from the last read_control_scene. Empty = unguarded write. A stale non-empty base returns err stale_base with current_hash.","name":"base","type":"String"},{"desc":"Short human label for the journal entry. May be empty.","name":"label","type":"String"},{"desc":"Who is making the change, recorded in the journal. May be empty.","name":"author","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"ltwuws19fa345cd8erb301","readers":[],"time":1785150688654,"username":"system","writers":[]}